  "v3 (Oct 27, 2026, 2nd UAT feedback): Sentence section dropped from the flow (reading = Letter, Word, Paragraph, Story); Number Recognition and Place Value are gates in Math; each section's sample (1-4) is chosen at random per child, so a child can get e.g. Sample 3 letters and Sample 1 story. Each step records its own sample number.",
  "Level ranks are unchanged from v1/v2 (Paragraph = 4, Story = 5) so results across versions stay comparable; Sentence (3) is simply not used in v3."
